## The Finding
Prospector beat `academic_intraday_anomalies` surfaced: Opening Range Breakout (ORB) – price moves beyond the first 30‑minute range predict strong directional drift -- The first‑hour range captures early market sentiment; breakouts tend to continue for the rest of the day, offering a timing edge for 0DTE SPY options and MES futures. Data source: Choudhry, T., & R. H. Hsu, "Opening Range Breakouts in the S&P 500 Index Futures," Journal of Financial Markets, Vol. 41, 2018, DOI:10.1016/j.finmar.2018.03.004. Cost: $0. Instrument fit: both.

